1
00:00:59,039 --> 00:00:59,600
Police Chief!

2
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,479
They said they're from the Provincial Bureau's Inspection Division.

3
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,119
They forced their way in.

4
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,039
I couldn't stop them.

5
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:05,640
Mu Gui.

6
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,760
Under Director Wu's orders, we're taking

7
00:01:07,879 --> 00:01:09,879
you back for suspension and investigation.

8
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:11,280
Something's wrong.

9
00:01:11,319 --> 00:01:11,640
Move!

10
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,000
Something's wrong.

11
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:12,920
Move! Take him away! Mu Ying!

12
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:13,560
Something's wrong!

13
00:01:24,359 --> 00:01:24,719
Boss.

14
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:25,400
We're done searching.

15
00:01:25,439 --> 00:01:26,120
Nothing suspicious.

16
00:01:27,319 --> 00:01:28,599
You two, go check over there again.

17
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:29,120
Yes, sir.

18
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,120
Be thorough. Yes, sir.

19
00:01:33,359 --> 00:01:33,879
Inspector Mu.

20
00:01:34,159 --> 00:01:34,599
No, wait.

21
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,000
Police Chief.

22
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,560
Lijia Town's officers follow your orders.

23
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,000
We'll go through fire and water

24
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:41,879
without hesitation.

25
00:01:42,879 --> 00:01:44,680
Please be the bigger person

26
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:45,560
and forgive us for not following orders before.

27
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,319
Shut up.

28
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,640
Cut the crap.

29
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,640
Keep accurate investigation records.

30
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,519
Yes, right away.

31
00:01:54,599 --> 00:01:55,799
Judging from the marks on the bones,

32
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,319
they died from drowning.

33
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:00,159
Before they died,

34
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,840
there were signs of struggle.

35
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:06,439
Using the human foundation sacrifice

36
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:08,919
as an excuse, Benefactor Li drowned them.

37
00:02:10,319 --> 00:02:11,520
How ruthless and wicked.

38
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,599
Unforgivable.

39
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:13,400
But

40
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:17,199
Benefactor Li did build bridges and roads.

41
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,240
He did a lot of good deeds.

42
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,120
You're wrong.

43
00:02:20,479 --> 00:02:22,000
Benefactor Li didn't build them

44
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,840
to benefit the people at all.

45
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,280
He just wanted to win people's hearts

46
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:29,800
and pose as a great benefactor

47
00:02:31,319 --> 00:02:33,240
to cover up stealing tomb artifacts

48
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,240
and committing murder.

49
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:39,479
The gold shop he opened in town

50
00:02:40,319 --> 00:02:42,439
wasn't to boost the local economy either.

51
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:44,400
It was to turn the gold from the tombs

52
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,759
into jewelry and sell it.

53
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:47,439
Your town

54
00:02:48,319 --> 00:02:50,080
was his best money-making tool.

55
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,520
To Lijia Town,

56
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,840
the great benefactor they revered

57
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:57,960
was actually

58
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:01,159
a heinous tomb raider

59
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,240
and murderer.

60
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,120
Burrowing Rat,

61
00:03:06,439 --> 00:03:06,960
Elder Ding,

62
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:07,960
Xiaobao,

63
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,360
We can finally say

64
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,639
we've avenged you.

65
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:14,120
I hope you can rest in peace now.

66
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,120
We'd better

67
00:03:34,639 --> 00:03:36,240
properly bury the grandpa and grandson.

68
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,479
You have been avenged.

69
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,879
You may rest in peace now.

70
00:04:29,279 --> 00:04:29,839
Master.

71
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,800
You're hallucinating again.

72
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,319
Jiang Huai,

73
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,120
in a few days,

74
00:04:39,519 --> 00:04:40,680
I'll take you to the provincial hospital

75
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:43,199
to see what's really wrong with your eyes.

76
00:04:44,199 --> 00:04:44,600
Sure.

77
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,000
There's one thing I still don't get.

78
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:52,600
Can you tell me now

79
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:53,959
why you helped me?

80
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,120
Helping you investigate the case...

81
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,720
...was actually for my own selfish reasons.

82
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:03,399
I've been trying to recover

83
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,720
the ancient book stolen from our library,

84
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:07,279
Heavenly Craftsmanship.

85
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:10,800
So, did you find it?

86
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:15,000
At the Li Manor,

87
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:16,720
I only saw the box it was kept in,

88
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,079
but the book wasn't inside.

89
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,120
In this entire world,

90
00:05:20,519 --> 00:05:21,959
there's only one Heavenly Craftsmanship.

91
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,720
So I have to get it back.

92
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:26,199
All right.

93
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:28,959
Since you helped me solve the case,

94
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:31,839
I'll help you track down the ancient book.

95
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:34,639
Okay.

96
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,639
Thank you.

97
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:50,319
Kid.

98
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,279
I've saved your master so many times.

99
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:56,199
You said

100
00:05:56,759 --> 00:05:58,040
you'd work like a dog for me.

101
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,600
What are you doing?

102
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:00,519
Let's go.

103
00:06:02,279 --> 00:06:02,639
Wait.

104
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:03,439
Do you need something?

105
00:06:03,519 --> 00:06:04,040
I do.

106
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:04,800
What do you want?

107
00:06:05,439 --> 00:06:06,279
That she-devil.

108
00:06:07,199 --> 00:06:07,879
And she has the nerve to say

109
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,600
she's the top student from the academy.

110
00:06:10,319 --> 00:06:11,199
Look at this mess.

111
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:12,800
How can anyone live here?

112
00:06:14,079 --> 00:06:15,000
Bossing me around.

113
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:15,920
Bossing me around.

114
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:16,800
Bossing me around.

115
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:17,759
Bossing me around.

116
00:06:20,759 --> 00:06:21,759
Useless at everything else,

117
00:06:22,519 --> 00:06:24,720
but number one at being a pig.

118
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:28,879
Watch how I deal with her.

119
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:37,480
Xun.

120
00:06:39,639 --> 00:06:41,040
Don't blame me for not warning you.

121
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,439
Are you sure you can take a beating?

122
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,240
It's fine.

123
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,519
Watch me scare her to death.

124
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,079
Shaman.

125
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:56,920
You took Benefactor Li's money

126
00:06:57,439 --> 00:06:58,240
to practice superstitious nonsense

127
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,000
and indirectly helped Benefactor Li

128
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,480
kill Elder Ding and Xiaobao.

129
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:04,399
As you didn't commit the crime directly,

130
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,120
the Police Chief granted special permission.

131
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,240
You can go now.

132
00:07:08,279 --> 00:07:09,680
I was foolish

133
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:10,519
and made a mistake.

134
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:12,120
Thank you for your mercy, Police Chief.

135
00:07:12,439 --> 00:07:13,360
Once you're out of here,

136
00:07:13,519 --> 00:07:15,120
drop that superstitious act.

137
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:16,959
I will definitely turn over a new leaf

138
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,879
and live an honest life.

139
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,839
Master Li.

140
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,160
Take care.

141
00:07:23,439 --> 00:07:25,639
I'll pray and burn incense for you daily.

142
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:31,000
These prayer beads will keep you safe.

143
00:07:31,519 --> 00:07:32,279
Put them on.

144
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:36,000
Let's go.

145
00:07:56,519 --> 00:07:57,000
Police Chief!

146
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:01,079
The shaman has been released.

147
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:02,439
Who did this?

148
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:06,240
Was it you, little brat?

149
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,040
You kid...

150
00:08:08,199 --> 00:08:08,680
Is there something wrong with you?

151
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,439
I didn't do it.

152
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:10,720
You want evidence? If not you, who did it?

153
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:11,759
If not you, did he do it?

154
00:08:11,839 --> 00:08:13,839
If that she-devil wasn't stopped earlier,

155
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:16,279
the washbasin would've hit her for sure.

156
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,199
By the same logic,

157
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:18,800
if Benefactor Li

158
00:08:18,959 --> 00:08:20,480
hadn't been delayed by other things,

159
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,319
he'd be dead by now,

160
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,720
nor would the others be killed by mistake.

161
00:08:25,279 --> 00:08:25,920
What's the deal with this kid?

162
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,519
Stop arguing!

163
00:08:28,639 --> 00:08:29,480
In the Li manor case,

164
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,399
we missed another killer.

165
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:33,000
What?

166
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,279
Missed another killer?

167
00:08:34,879 --> 00:08:35,320
That's right.

168
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:36,440
Hurry.

169
00:08:36,879 --> 00:08:37,639
Bring Benefactor Li in for questioning!

170
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,480
Let's go.

171
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:39,320
Move!

172
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:47,879
You're absolutely right.

173
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:51,200
There is indeed such an expert.

174
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:53,039
He knows everything.

175
00:08:55,919 --> 00:08:57,639
I have plans with my wife. I must leave.

176
00:08:58,159 --> 00:08:58,799
Sir,

177
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:00,039
please go back for now.

178
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,120
I have a big deal

179
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,759
that I can only discuss with you.

180
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,000
What big deal?

181
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,519
That ancient book, Heavenly Craftsmanship,

182
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,679
is in your hands.

183
00:09:15,679 --> 00:09:16,320
That's right.

184
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,600
This book is mine.

185
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,879
I bought it from out of town.

186
00:09:21,519 --> 00:09:23,600
Sell this book to me.

187
00:09:25,679 --> 00:09:26,440
Sir,

188
00:09:27,559 --> 00:09:29,080
how much silver do you want?

189
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,200
Name your price.

190
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:31,759
But this book

191
00:09:32,399 --> 00:09:33,840
is a unique Ming dynasty copy.

192
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,200
It's priceless.

193
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,480
I'm not selling.

194
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,320
Then what if we use your life

195
00:09:39,399 --> 00:09:40,600
in exchange for this book?

196
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,159
I guarantee you won't die.

197
00:09:44,919 --> 00:09:45,559
How about it?

198
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,639
This expert,

199
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:51,159
he kept his word.

200
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:54,440
He saved me from assassination every time,

201
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:55,759
causing Chunmei and the others

202
00:09:58,039 --> 00:10:00,240
to kill Mengzhu and my wife by mistake.

203
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,039
What did this expert look like?

204
00:10:07,639 --> 00:10:08,919
Every time he came to see me,

205
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,120
he wore a suit and...

206
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:14,960
What's wrong?

207
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:16,840
What's wrong with you?

208
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,120
Benefactor Li!

209
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:22,960
What's wrong?

210
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:23,919
Someone!

211
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:24,720
Get him to a hospital!

212
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:25,919
Someone, hurry!

213
00:10:27,159 --> 00:10:27,720
Benefactor Li!
